post-it: Mouse glitches
symptoms:
	Slow computer
		shows: Windows takes three times as long to start, and a folder takes 2 seconds to open
checks:
	Windows starts quickly
		shows: the Windows splash screen lasts three times as long
	Folders open at once
		shows: a folder takes 2 seconds to open
software steps:
	Open Start, Programs, Accessories, System Tools, Disk Defragmenter
	Click Start: it defragments drive C:
	Leave the computer on overnight: the run finishes by the next day
notes:
	WILL TAKE UNTIL EVENING NEXT DAY
